DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
27566::$$$message_0204_0000_0000$$$::I arrive at Rider's bedroom.[lr]::
27567::$$$message_0204_0000_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
27568::$$$message_0204_0000_0002$$$::I'm reluctant to be here, but I need to hear Rider's thoughts.[lr]::
27569::$$$message_0204_0000_0003$$$::I don't feel quite comfortable asking her during daytime, but it's easier to bring this up a little later at night.::
27570::$$$message_0204_0001_0000$$$::"Hey, Rider? I'd like to talk."[lr]::
27571::$$$message_0204_0001_0001$$$::I call her name and open the sliding door.[lr]::
27572::$$$message_0204_0001_0002$$$::I'll lead with small talk and see how she reacts before getting down to business.::
27573::$$$message_0204_0002_0000$$$::"I see. [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服02a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=600][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 pos=r time=1300 accel=0 storage=ライダー私服02a(近)]To be honest, I think it is fine as long as Sakura isn't in any danger. Even if the Holy Grail War intensifies and the town is on the verge of total ruin, it's no concern of mine."[wm canskip=0]::
27574::$$$message_0204_0003_0000$$$::   So...[lr]::
27575::$$$message_0204_0003_0001$$$::Rider coolly tells me how she really feels. Maybe Sakura's absence is working to my benefit.[lr]::
27576::$$$message_0204_0003_0002$$$::I take that back[line len=2]It's anything but a benefit. She says it with such intensity that it makes me feel a chill up my spine. [wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][rep force=1 textoff=0 fliplr=0 storages=ライダー私服02a(中) time=100 flipud=0 poss=c bg=i衛宮邸_ライダー部屋-(夜) indexes=2000]::
27577::$$$message_0204_0004_0000$$$::"...I see. Um, I know it's extremely unlikely, but if Sakura does end up wanting to fight, would you join the war?"::
27578::$$$message_0204_0005_0000$$$::"If Sakura desires victory, then yes.[lr]::
27579::$$$message_0204_0005_0001$$$::I would do everything in my power to help her win the Holy Grail War this time. I'm prepared to deploy a Blood Fort of a scale beyond anything Caster has crafted, just as I did over the school.[lr]::
27580::$$$message_0204_0005_0002$$$::If you intend to stop me, Shirou, I won't hold back, not even against you."::
27581::$$$message_0204_0006_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
27582::$$$message_0204_0006_0001$$$::...That's tough. It pains me to say that if some tragedy hypothetically[line len=2]just hypothetically, really[line len=2]drove Sakura to such lengths, I'm not sure I wouldn't try to stop her.[lr]::
27583::$$$message_0204_0006_0002$$$::If she steps off the path, then I need to correct her.[lr]::
27584::$$$message_0204_0006_0003$$$::Rider knows that, so she isn't asking me to take Sakura's side.::
27585::$$$message_0204_0007_0000$$$::"Okay. Let's set aside the what-ifs.[lr]::
27586::$$$message_0204_0007_0001$$$::I'm surprised, Rider. I thought you were a more passive person."[lr]::
27587::$$$message_0204_0007_0002$$$::I didn't expect her to say she'd be willing to sacrifice every person in Fuyuki.[lr]::
27588::$$$message_0204_0007_0003$$$::My impression of Rider for the last six months has been that of a woman of many interests, yet generally inactive.::
27589::$$$message_0204_0008_0000$$$::"I believe your deduction is correct, Shirou. I'm not used to acting on my own volition.[lr]::
27590::$$$message_0204_0008_0001$$$::But that is irrelevant if conflict is thrust upon me. I will do everything I can to win a battle.[lr]::
27591::$$$message_0204_0008_0002$$$::I'll kill when it's time to kill, cruelly and mercilessly. I will make sure our enemy can never get up again or attempt to challenge us."::
27592::$$$message_0204_0009_0000$$$::"Rider..."[lr]::
27593::$$$message_0204_0009_0001$$$::...I feel a chill coming on, and I don't mean that figuratively.[lr]::
27594::$$$message_0204_0009_0002$$$::The Mystic Eyes behind her glasses have paralyzed my limbs, even though they're being held back.::
27595::$$$message_0204_0010_0000$$$::"...But that's only if someone picks a fight.[lr]::
27596::$$$message_0204_0010_0001$$$::No, even if Sakura wants to fight, she won't let you use methods like that. Am I wrong?"[wm canskip=0]::
27597::$$$message_0204_0011_0000$$$::"...Most likely. But my approach fundamentally differs from hers. I believe Saber also mentioned how ruthless I can be.[lr]::
27598::$$$message_0204_0011_0001$$$::I won't deny it. I don't possess a pure, noble soul like she does. My personality morphs in battle. I would probably kill anyone as I please."[wm canskip=0]::
27599::$$$message_0204_0012_0000$$$::...I'm getting a bad sense of déjà vu.[lr]::
27600::$$$message_0204_0012_0001$$$::Rider's self-deprecating words[lr]::
27601::$$$message_0204_0012_0002$$$::conjure sinister images in my mind.::
27602::$$$message_0204_0013_0000$$$::"You're wrong... [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]That won't happen, Rider.[lr]::
27603::$$$message_0204_0013_0001$$$::We've lived under the same roof for half a year. I can tell what kind of person you are, whether I want to or not. You aren't a... I won't let you say that you haven't changed."[lr]::
27604::$$$message_0204_0013_0002$$$::My dizziness must be affecting me.[lr]::
27605::$$$message_0204_0013_0003$$$::I feel like a fool. I'm getting way too emotional.::
27606::$$$message_0204_0014_0000$$$::"...Shirou. This is a good time to give you a warning.[lr]::
27607::$$$message_0204_0014_0001$$$::I am a monster, a being of terror, just as your legends describe.[lr]::
27608::$$$message_0204_0014_0002$$$::My hands are stained with blood. In the past, many heroes challenged my temple, and I devoured them all without exception.[lr]::
27609::$$$message_0204_0014_0003$$$::Just because I have taken on a human form doesn't mean my past can be denied."::
27610::$$$message_0204_0015_0000$$$::"...I know the legend of Medusa.[lr]::
27611::$$$message_0204_0015_0001$$$::But they forced that on you. You were always getting attacked."[lr]::
27612::$$$message_0204_0015_0002$$$::It wasn't Rider's fault that they vilified her as a monster, nor that humans kept coming after her.[lr]::
27613::$$$message_0204_0015_0003$$$::The monster known as Medusa was a victim from start to finish.::
27614::$$$message_0204_0016_0000$$$::"...The fact you aren't attacking people right now proves it. You cherish Sakura, and you're considerate to the rest of us, too. You're a proper human."::
27615::$$$message_0204_0017_0000$$$::"...That's only because I'm here as Medusa the Heroic Spirit.[lr]::
27616::$$$message_0204_0017_0001$$$::Servants, no, Heroic Spirits are summoned as heroes in the prime of their lives. The version of me that's here is called Medusa, but it's only a representation of me when I still looked like a human."::
27617::$$$message_0204_0018_0000$$$::"However, the fact that I am Medusa means that there is an aspect of me that will change into a monster.[lr]::
27618::$$$message_0204_0018_0001$$$::I'm not the person you imagine me to be.[lr]::
27619::$$$message_0204_0018_0002$$$::Medusa is a literal monster, a hideous creature who grew endlessly and became known to humanity as an absolute evil."::
27620::$$$message_0204_0019_0000$$$::"...Ngh."[lr]::
27621::$$$message_0204_0019_0001$$$::...I've thought about this before,[lr]::
27622::$$$message_0204_0019_0002$$$::the differences between the monster from Greek mythology and the Rider I know.[lr]::
27623::$$$message_0204_0019_0003$$$::I had a vague notion that the legends were wrong,[lr]::
27624::$$$message_0204_0019_0004$$$::but wishful thinking is no comfort before this very real curse.::
27625::$$$message_0204_0020_0000$$$::"I killed, and I changed each time I took a life.[lr]::
27626::$$$message_0204_0020_0001$$$::The greater my reputation became, the more humans came to challenge me.[lr]::
27627::$$$message_0204_0020_0002$$$::Humans, monsters, and heroes will always be at odds with each other. Humans cannot defeat monsters. No matter how many thousands of soldiers they send, they will never overcome monsters as long as they remain [font italic=true]human[font italic=false]. That law protected me and allowed my monstrous tendencies to grow."[wm canskip=0][wdash canskip=0]::
27628::$$$message_0204_0021_0000$$$::Humans, demons, and heroes are deadlocked.[lr]::
27629::$$$message_0204_0021_0001$$$::Humans can't beat monsters, monsters are defeated by heroes, and heroes are regulated by humans.[lr]::
27630::$$$message_0204_0021_0002$$$::Protected by that law, Medusa became a monster who matured as she slaughtered human after human, until she was eventually offered up as a sacrifice to a hero...[wm canskip=0]::
27631::$$$message_0204_0022_0000$$$::"That is my true identity, Shirou. You have no idea what my original body was like.[lr]::
27632::$$$message_0204_0022_0001$$$::You don't know how long I was trapped in that temple. You have no inkling of what I grew and morphed into after eating countless heroes.[lr]::
27633::$$$message_0204_0022_0002$$$::...Even I can't imagine what sort of monster I'll become eventually."::
27634::$$$message_0204_0023_0000$$$::Rider confesses that she'll always be an incarnation of a monster, no matter what she does to make up for her past deeds.[lr]::
27635::$$$message_0204_0023_0001$$$::I don't have the right or the power to deny that. ::
27636::$$$message_0204_0024_0000$$$::"...Why are you saying all this now?[lr]::
27637::$$$message_0204_0024_0001$$$::I've never seen you that way, and that won't change.[lr]::
27638::$$$message_0204_0024_0002$$$::Just like Saber..."[lr]::
27639::$$$message_0204_0024_0003$$$::I don't want them to get dragged into another war. I regret that her answer to that is this confession.::
27640::$$$message_0204_0025_0000$$$::"...I'm being pathetic. All I can do is tell you not to do that."[lr]::
27641::$$$message_0204_0025_0001$$$::"No, it was mean-spirited of me, too. I felt an urge to mess with you, for some reason."::
27642::$$$message_0204_0026_0000$$$::"But I'm glad we talked. Your perspective on me is nice, even if it's also pointed.[lr]::
27643::$$$message_0204_0026_0001$$$::That's why I wanted you to know this, should the time ever come."::
27644::$$$message_0204_0027_0000$$$::I don't feel the dark presence from her anymore.[lr]::
27645::$$$message_0204_0027_0001$$$::Rider's back to her usual self. She gives me a bow.::
27646::$$$message_0204_0028_0000$$$::"I'm sorry for troubling you, but please don't forget, Shirou. I will become a man-eating monster when the time comes."[lr]::
27647::$$$message_0204_0028_0001$$$::I hear a faint pleading in her voice.[lr]::
27648::$$$message_0204_0028_0002$$$::"...All right. I'll be ready.[lr]::
27649::$$$message_0204_0028_0003$$$::But that is just a what-if. As long as Sakura is your Master, it won't ever come to that."::
27650::$$$message_0204_0029_0000$$$::I wonder how much of Rider's feelings I managed to understand.[lr]::
27651::$$$message_0204_0029_0001$$$::For now, I just return her resolute gaze and leave her room.::
927575::$$$message_9204_0003_0001$$$::Rider coolly tells me how she really feels. Maybe Sakura's absence is working to my benefit.[r]::

